  "title": "Semantic Anchoring Personalization (SAP) and C2P-VAR Frameworks for Personalization in Vision Models",
  "summary": "This paper introduces SAP, which balances subject fidelity and text-image alignment through semantic anchoring, while C2P-VAR provides a unified framework for both continual and compositional personalization in VAR models. Both approaches address challenges like catastrophic forgetting and feature interference, demonstrating improved performance in subject fidelity.",
